SynchroMode|DCMIPP_SYNCHRO_HARDWARE|Hardware Synchronization
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_BYTE|DCMIPP_FORMAT_BYTE
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_YUV422|DCMIPP_FORMAT_YUV422
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RGB565|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RGB565
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RGB888|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RGB888
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RAW8|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RAW8
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_MONOCHROME_8B|DCMIPP_FORMAT_MONOCHROME_8B
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RAW10|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RAW10
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_MONOCHROME_10B|DCMIPP_FORMAT_MONOCHROME_10B
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RAW12|DCMIPP_FORMAT_RAW12
Format|DCMIPP_FORMAT_MONOCHROME_12B|DCMIPP_FORMAT_MONOCHROME_12B
