DCMIPP_VPolarity|DCMIPP_VSPOLARITY_LOW|Low
DCMIPP_VPolarity|DCMIPP_VSPOLARITY_HIGH|High
DCMIPP_HPolarity|DCMIPP_HSPOLARITY_LOW|Low
DCMIPP_HPolarity|DCMIPP_HSPOLARITY_HIGH|High
DCMIPP_PCKPOLARITY|DCMIPP_PCKPOLARITY_FALLING|Falling
DCMIPP_PCKPOLARITY|DCMIPP_PCKPOLARITY_RISING|Rising
SwapBits|DCMIPP_SWAPBITS_DISABLE|Disabled
